 intro:B('Study the worked tables and examples, then predict and write Python. An operator tells Python what to do with values: calculate a new value, compare values, or combine conditions.','Kaji jadual dan contoh berpandu, kemudian ramal dan tulis Python. Operator memberitahu Python tindakan terhadap nilai: mengira nilai baharu, membandingkan nilai atau menggabungkan syarat.','先学习表格与示例，再预测并编写 Python。运算符告诉 Python 如何处理值：计算新值、比较数值，或组合条件。'),
 symbol:B('Python operator','Operator Python','Python 运算符'),meaning:B('What it means','Maksudnya','含义'),example:B('Python example','Contoh Python','Python 示例'),result:B('Result','Hasil','结果'),why:B('Read it like this','Baca seperti ini','这样理解'),
 arithmeticTitle:B('1 · Arithmetic: calculate with values','1 · Aritmetik: kira dengan nilai','1 · 算术：用数值计算'),
